Package: sun-accent-popup
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, ibus
Description: hold a key to choose an accented character
 An IBus input method for US QWERTY keyboards on Ubuntu/GNOME,
 with a separate practice window. Includes desktop input source registration.
